# A screw thread made through its screen, then its groups hidden by the box
# of its row in the group list and the thread suppressed whole from its
# screen; the same model as path_thread_whole.go makes
# (TestPathEquivalenceThreadWhole).
key c
move 300 300
down L 300 300
up L 300 300
move 350 300
down L 350 300
up L 350 300
key esc
key x shift
move 350 300
down L 350 300
up L 350 300
menu Features|Screw Thread...
# The designation, the length, an internal thread, then make it.
twmove 172 110
twdown L 172 110
twup L 172 110
edit M6x1
twmove 220 150
twdown L 220 150
twup L 220 150
edit 9
twmove 181 190
twdown L 181 190
twup L 181 190
# Flip the direction: against the circle's normal, down into the part.
twmove 60 230
twdown L 60 230
twup L 60 230
twmove 37 260
twdown L 37 260
twup L 37 260
# Home: the thread's row, its box hides its four groups.
twmove 28 10
twdown L 28 10
twup L 28 10
twmove 62 180
twdown L 62 180
twup L 62 180
# Its name opens its screen: suppress the thread.
twmove 200 180
twdown L 200 180
twup L 200 180
twmove 462 170
twdown L 462 170
twup L 462 170
